```
Show when crate has tracks; hide otherwise. Note computed in renderCrates:
- known temps of tracks in order.
- if fewer than 2 known BPM, note "Añade BPM o más pistas para ver saltos de tempo."
- else compute max jump between consecutive tracks where both known: `Math.abs(bpm[i+1]-bpm[i])` and if > 8 flag: "Salto de tempo: A → B (+X BPM). Mezcla gradual o ajusta el orden." Else "Transiciones dentro de ±8 BPM."
- Also show range: `Rango 120.0–128.0 BPM`.

Sorting:
```js
function sortSetlistByBpm(direction) {
  const crate = activeCrate();
  if (!crate || crate.trackIds.length < 2) { toast('Añade al menos dos pistas para ordenar.'); return; }
  const bpmOf = id => { const t = library.find(track => track.id === id); const bpm = Number(t?.bpm); return Number.isFinite(bpm) && bpm > 0 ? bpm : null; };
  crate.trackIds.sort((a,b) => {
    const aB = bpmOf(a), bB = bpmOf(b);
    if (aB === null && bB === null) return 0;
    if (aB === null) return 1;
    if (bB === null) return -1;
    return direction === 'asc' ? aB - bB : bB - aB;
  });
  persistCrates(); renderCrates();
  toast(`Setlist ordenado por BPM ${direction === 'asc' ? 'ascendente' : 'descendente'}.`);
}
```
